": "Causes NaN activations on a minority of fine-tuning sequences; no GLUE score reported, so this configuration is not the one ultimately recommended despite being the headline 'most simplified block' in Figure 1."}, {"id": "2311_01906_finetuning_stability", "label": "Fine-tuning stability (NaN activations)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "2311.01906.md", "source_location": "L221", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "2311_01906_codeparrot_experiment", "label": "CodeParrot decoder-only training-speed experiment", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "2311.01906.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Headline result reported as single runs without repeated-seed comparison, a less rigorous evidentiary standard than the paper's own GLUE seed-variance comparison."}, {"id": "2311_01906_bert_glue_transfer", "label": "BERT/GLUE transfer experiment", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "2311.01906.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "2311_01906_depth_scaling_experiment", "label": "Depth-scaling experiment (up to 72 blocks)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "2311.01906.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Suggestive evidence against depth-related failure of the main result, but explicitly not presented as resolving the scale question."}, {"id": "2311_01906_palm_parallel_blocks", "label": "PaLM parallel-block scaling finding", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "2311.01906.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}], "edges": [{"source": "2311_01906_paper", "target": "2311_01906_he_et_al_2023", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXT